  "description": "Erection of rear dormer extension to facilitate loft conversion and sub-division of 1 x self-contained flat at first and second floor levels into 2 x self-contained flats (Class C3) over first floor (flat 1) and at second floor/roof level (flat 2). Installation of front rooflight. Creation of third floor roof terrace above existing rear extension enclosed by a glass balustrade screen attached to a low-level brick parapet wall and extending to 1.7m in height.",
